{
  "_about": "Ireland test set, prepared 2026-10-29. Ten named public civic or commercial places (shopping centres, a railway station, council offices, a civic square, a quay, City Hall), no housing street, no residence, no house number and no full Eircode. `expect` is the oracle in ranges, as in eval/us/addresses.json; lower facility bounds stay below the raw counts until the first live run confirms them. Coordinates and the `geocode` blocks come from live Nominatim responses on 2026-10-29 (accept-language=en), snapped to 3 decimals. When the `ie` region is on, these addresses run without a sign-in.",
